257
00:23:26,400 --> 00:23:29,280
‫♪ Like I'm dancing in a birdcage.

258
00:23:30,110 --> 00:23:31,780
‫♪ Weak and pierced
‫Till it's mended

259
00:23:31,910 --> 00:23:33,620
‫♪ Struggling and crying
‫And try not to disappear

260
00:23:33,740 --> 00:23:35,370
‫♪ It's so convenient like some magic

261
00:23:35,490 --> 00:23:37,160
‫♪ If you're the hero,
‫there's a beginning and an end

262
00:23:37,290 --> 00:23:39,250
‫♪ No matter what happens in the end,
‫it's always a happy ending

263
00:23:39,370 --> 00:23:41,290
‫♪ Then let me do what I want

264
00:23:41,420 --> 00:23:43,790
‫♪ I don't care anymore.

265
00:23:44,090 --> 00:23:45,670
‫♪ I fell headlong

266
00:23:45,800 --> 00:23:47,920
‫♪ into a zero-gravity Midnight escape

267
00:23:48,090 --> 00:23:50,840
‫♪ The Secret Behind the Secret,
